updatedAt: timestamp

// Notes:
// - Connects subscriber to a product (not directly to curator)
// - Controlled via CQRS (commands, queries, events)
// - Stripe integration handles billing, webhooks update status
// - Deletion of a product will delete related subscriptions + trigger NotifyEvent


